# Format: instruction_id unit_type num_units latency cache_size cache_assoc cache_line cache_banks

# At instruction 20000:
# - Reduce SP units from 8 to 4
# - Reduce SFU units from 8 to 4 
# - Reduce DP units from 8 to 4
# - Reduce INT units from 8 to 4
# - Reduce Tensor units from 8 to 4
# - Reduce L1D cache size from 256KB to 128KB
# - Reduce L1D associativity from 64 to 32

20000 SP 4 20 131072 32 128 4
20000 SFU 4 100 131072 32 128 4  
20000 DP 4 40 131072 32 128 4
20000 INT 4 20 131072 32 128 4
20000 TENSOR 4 64 131072 32 128 4

# The format of each line is:
# <instruction_id> <unit_type> <num_units> <latency> <cache_size> <cache_assoc> <cache_line_size> <cache_banks>

# Cache configuration values:
# - cache_size: 128KB (131072 bytes) - reduced from 256KB
# - cache_assoc: 32-way - reduced from 64-way
# - cache_line: 128 bytes (unchanged)
# - cache_banks: 4 banks (unchanged)

# Unit configuration values:
# - SP units: Reduced from 8 to 4, latency 20 cycles
# - SFU units: Reduced from 8 to 4, latency 100 cycles
# - DP units: Reduced from 8 to 4, latency 40 cycles 
# - INT units: Reduced from 8 to 4, latency 20 cycles
# - Tensor units: Reduced from 8 to 4, latency 64 cycles